cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Jeśli korzystasz z tego programu, zacytuj go według tych metadanych.
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "GeoAI Klasyfikator"
abstract: >-
  Open source software for supervised, object-based land cover mapping
  (GEOBIA) from RGB drone, aerial and Sentinel-2 imagery: SLIC
  segmentation, 19 or 24 object features, class separability check,
  Random Forest classification and design-based accuracy assessment
  with area estimates and 95% confidence intervals. QGIS plugin,
  command line program and Windows application sharing one core.
authors:
  - family-names: "Górniak"
    given-names: "Grzegorz"
    affiliation: "Nicolaus Copernicus University in Toruń"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/gorniakgrzegorz/geoai_klasyfikator"
url: "https://gorniakgrzegorz.github.io/geoai_klasyfikator/"
keywords:
  - GEOBIA
  - object-based image analysis
  - land cover classification
  - Random Forest
  - SLIC
  - UAV
  - Sentinel-2
  - accuracy assessment
  - QGIS plugin
  - remote sensing
